      "n": 5,
      "quote": "_It can teach the model to generate responses in a specific format and tone._ To ensure that our legal copilot outputs reliable, well-sourced and professionally formatted legal answers, we've fine-tuned the `mistral-small` model, focusing on improving response structure and sourcing."
