  "answer_markdown": "To investigate who deleted conversations, the administrator should query audit logs for the activity `le_chat.conversation.deleted` under the `event_type` field. This event type records when a le Chat conversation is deleted [3].\n\nTo narrow results to a specific human user, the query can use the `actor_user_uuid` parameter, which filters logs by the UUID of the user who performed the action [4].\n\nBy default, each request returns a maximum of 20 entries, as specified by the `limit` parameter [4].\n\nHere is the code to perform this query:\n\n```\nGET /v1/admin/audit-logs?event_type=le_chat.conversation.deleted&actor_user_uuid=<USER_UUID>&limit=20\n```\n\n> Replace `<USER_UUID>` with the UUID of the user being investigated.",
